{"id":"4293e1643a9254d8","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-sequence.md","title":"Finite Sequence","display":"df-sequence — Finite Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-sequence","aliases":["90-df-sequence"],"display":"df-sequence — Finite Sequence","depends_on":["[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequence — Finite Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(s \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (candidate code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i \\in \\mathbb{N}\">\\(i \\in \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (元素下标)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}\\)</span> (encoded-sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}\\)</span> (encoded-sequence length, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s)^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i\">\\((s)^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i\\)</span> (encoded-sequence entry, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}\\)</span> (finite-sequence predicate, defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Len}\">\\(\\mathrm{Len}\\)</span> (finite-sequence length function, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Seq}(s)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Len}(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s),\\\\\n(s)_i&amp;\\coloneqq(s)^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i\\qquad(i\\in\\mathbb N).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sequence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Seq}(s)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Len}(s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}(s),\\\\\n(s)_i&amp;\\coloneqq(s)^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i\\qquad(i\\in\\mathbb N).\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}(s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}(s)\\)</span>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 是有限序列的 Gödel 编码</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Len}(s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Len}(s)\\)</span>: 序列长度</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s)_i\">\\((s)_i\\)</span>: 第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个元素（从 0 开始）</li>\n<li>对非法编码或越界下标，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Len}\">\\(\\mathrm{Len}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s)_i\">\\((s)_i\\)</span> 沿用上游默认值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>；有效序列语义仍由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}(s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}(s)\\)</span> 守卫。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5dc32170bd55a322\" href=\"?note=5dc32170bd55a322\" title=\"90-df-sequence-encoding\">90-df-sequence-encoding</a> — 序列编码</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Seq}_{\\mathrm{enc}}$ (encoded-sequence predicate, see [[90-df-sequence-encoding]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Len}_{\\mathrm{enc}}$ (encoded-sequence length, see [[90-df-sequence-encoding]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(s)^{\\mathrm{enc}}_i$ (encoded-sequence entry, see [[90-df-sequence-encoding]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sequence-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"5dc32170bd55a322","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[90-df-sequence-encoding]] — 序列编码","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s \\in \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"i \